# Data from late September 2026 on lives only on the Hugging Face Hub (see
# README). Git keeps tracking the data committed before then, so curation
# edits to it can still be committed; new batches, runs, and sets, and new
# files in the old runs, are ignored.
prompts/batch_*/
responses/run_*/
responses/sets/
preferences/run_*/
preferences/pairs/
# local files not meant for the repository
*do_not_commit*
